<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Primedia yr shr rises, maiden div.</title>
<headline>Primedia yr shr rises, maiden div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended June 30 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, attrib after</p>
<p>    exceptional items (cts)    50	  vs    38</p>
<p>    Div (cts)			 6	  vs    nil</p>
<p>    Attrib income	     12.94	  vs    5.33</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		     17.16	  vs    6.68</p>
<p>    Tax			    2.98	  vs    0.62</p>
<p>    Interest paid		2.75	  vs    1.45</p>
<p>    Turnover		   186.52	  vs  108.91</p>
<p>Div payable on or about September 27</p>
<p>on register September 14</p>
<p>Full name: Primedia Limited</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  0.35	  vs    0.20</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
